{
  "name": "farm_maintain_loop",
  "version": "3",
  "description": "种田维护：初始化 continue=1；while(continue>0, max_iters=8){ farm_nearby → 记录 harvested → guard }；guard continue==0；最后 get_self_status。farm_nearby 收成熟并原地复位，不需要单独播种积木。一次调用走完全链。",
  "tags": [
    "farming",
    "harvest",
    "sow",
    "maintain",
    "bounded_loop",
    "offline_draft"
  ],
  "planner_notes": "离线 dдraft2（活库未改）：①半径12技术起点（25×25×9≈5625格/次，总farm≤8⇒扫描上界≈4.5万格），性能未实机。②循环体只放同步 farm_nearby；set 用严格 $calc 绑定 $prev.harvested（桥已解包 TaskResult.data），缺字段抛错→FAIL，不会比较成0误SUCCESS。③实测形状（9场景，exit0）：3→1→0 成功 farm3；首0成功 farm1；8正值 PAUSED farm8；第8轮零成功 farm8；缺字段/工具失败/错误data路径/负数 FAIL。④停止原因：harvest=0→条件停=局部无成熟（非世界无资源）；连续正值到上限→PAUSED（非农事SUCCESS）；失败/缺字段→FAIL。⑤sow=0 仅报零，原因待真实回执细分（无种子/无空地不自动推断）；满包原地掉落不自动拾取，汇总不得称全部入库。⑥取消只承诺步边界；同步 farm/sow 调用中不可取消。⑦ 2026-11-07：已核实严格加载下不存在 sow_nearby 积木（静态校验失败），删除该步；farm_nearby 自身收+复位。",
  "safety_notes": "只碰成熟作物与空耕地；不拆块、不改地形；无种子时 sow 报0；不把受理/PAUSED 当 SUCCESS。",
  "limits": {
    "max_steps": 64,
    "max_timeout_ms": 300000
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "read",
      "block": "get_self_status",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "init",
      "block": "set",
      "params": {
        "continue": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cycle",
      "block": "while",
      "params": {
        "condition": {
          "field": "$var.continue",
          "op": ">",
          "value": 0
        },
        "max_iters": 8,
        "stagnant_limit": 9
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "harvest",
          "block": "farm_nearby",
          "params": {
            "radius": 12
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "update",
          "block": "set",
          "params": {
            "continue": {
              "$calc": "$prev.harvested"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "nonneg",
          "block": "guard",
          "params": {
            "condition": {
              "field": "$var.continue",
              "op": ">=",
              "value": 0
            },
            "message": "harvested 出现负数/异常，停止（不把异常当0）",
            "on_fail": "fail"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stopok",
      "block": "guard",
      "params": {
        "condition": {
          "field": "$var.continue",
          "op": "==",
          "value": 0
        },
        "message": "循环非正常退出（continue!=0），不报农事完成",
        "on_fail": "fail"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "done",
      "block": "get_self_status",
      "params": {}
    }
  ]
}
